        ],
        "text": "The root problem was that the baseline validated inputs but simulated only a single attempt, returning 'failed' for any non-success outcome. The requirement is bounded retries: temporary failures should advance to the next supplied outcome until success, permanent failure, the attempt limit, or outcome exhaustion.",
        "verification": "OBSERVED"
      },
      "solution_design": {
        "evidenceIds": ["context-source-1", "context-source-3"],
        "text": "Iterate over outcomes.slice(0, maxAttempts) with an attempts counter. Return {status:'success', attempts} on 'success', break on 'permanent', and return {status:'failed', attempts} if the loop completes. Preserve all existing validation. Add retry.test.mjs with parameterized cases.",
        "verification": "OBSERVED"
      },
